      "content": "i get that, but i've read so much online about how natural supplements are much safer than synthetic drugs. like, it's just a plant, right? i feel like my doctor would just tell me to take an antidepressant, and i really want to avoid that. is there any way to know for sure if it'll actually interfere with my pill or is it just a minor thing?",
