      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but honestly i'm just really nervous about the pill failing. i've looked up some stuff and it says it's mostly about how the body processes things. if i just take a lower dose of the st johns wort, like maybe half of what's on the bottle, would that make it safer or keep the interaction from happening? i really don't want to wait weeks for an appointment just to ask this.",
